### Argo Rollouts Configuration (`argo-rollouts.yaml`)

Create an `argo-rollouts.yaml` file to implement canary rollouts and automated rollbacks:

```yaml
apiVersion: argoproj.io/v1alpha1
kind: Rollout
metadata:
  name: fastapi-app
spec:
  selector:
    matchLabels:
      app: fastapi-app
  template:
    metadata:
      labels:
        app: fastapi-app
    spec:
      containers:
      - name: fastapi-app
        image: fastapi-app:latest
        ports:
        - containerPort: 8000
  strategy:
    canary:
      steps:
      - setWeight: 20
        canary: true
  failedUpdatePolicy:
    retry:
      count: 3
  successUpdatePolicy:
    retry:
      count: 3
  failedUpdatePolicy:
    rollbackTo:
      revision: 1
```

